For an existing CMake target named main, link the SOCI Core component:

    find_package(SOCI 4.1 COMPONENTS Core CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE SOCI::SOCI)

Add the enabled backend components your application needs to COMPONENTS, such as
MySQL or SQLite3. CMake component names are case-sensitive; use these spellings
rather than lowercase vcpkg backend feature names.
